\p{\strong{To clarify:}}

\ul{
\li{PAC: we assume there exists a “magical” #{O(1)} oracle.}
\li{EQMQ: we assume EQs take polynomial time. Note, if this is an impossible thing to do (i.e. if you can prove any EQ would have to take more than polynomial time) then the concept class is just ruled \em{not} EQMQ learnable.}
